This subpackage contains Arimo. It was designed by Steve Matteson as an 
innovative, refreshing sans serif design that is metrically compatible 
with Arial™. Arimo offers improved on-screen readability characteristics 
and the pan-European WGL character set and solves the needs of developers 
looking for width-compatible fonts to address document portability across 
platforms.

For more information have a look at the upstream website: 
https://github.com/googlefonts/Arimo
